---
layout: base.njk
title: Our Story — Admizz Group
description: Founded in 2015, Admizz Group has grown from a single idea into three ventures spanning education, test preparation and workforce development.
permalink: /about/
---

{# ============================================================ PAGE HEADER
   A full-width masthead stack, deliberately not the 14rem/1fr split grid used
   elsewhere (Contact's header uses that grid for genuinely different content —
   a details list beside a form; reusing it here for a single text block was
   the repeated-module problem). Ventures' header is navy full-bleed; this one
   is paper, single-column — a real structural difference, not just a recolor. #}
<section class="bg-paper py-section">
  <div class="shell max-w-measure">
    <span class="eyebrow fade-up">Our Story</span>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-display font-light text-display-2 text-ink max-w-[16ch] text-balance fade-up" style="animation-delay:80ms">
      Building since <em class="italic text-navy font-book">2015.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-body-lg text-ink-muted leading-relaxed fade-up" style="animation-delay:140ms">
      {{ site.description }}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ THE RECORD (full timeline) #}
<section class="bg-paper-sunk py-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="eyebrow fade-up">The Record</span>
    <div class="mt-8 max-w-measure relative">
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-8 inset-y-2 w-px bg-rule-strong" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      {% for t in timeline %}
      <div class="relative flex gap-6 md:gap-10 py-8 border-t border-rule first:border-t-0 fade-up" style="animation-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 90 }}ms">
        <span class="font-mono text-small text-navy-soft font-medium tabular-nums shrink-0 w-16 relative z-10 bg-paper-sunk">{{ t.year }}</span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-display font-book text-ink">{{ t.label }}</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-body text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">{{ t.text }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ FOUNDER #}
<section class="bg-paper py-section">
  <div class="shell grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,22rem)_1fr] gap-10 md:gap-16 items-start">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-navy-deep">
        {% image "src/assets/images/people/founder.png", "Manish K Sah, Founder & CEO of Admizz Group", "(min-width: 768px) 22rem, 90vw", [400, 640, 900] %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fade-up" style="animation-delay:100ms">
      <span class="eyebrow">Leadership</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-light text-h2 text-ink max-w-[16ch] text-balance">A vision for what's next.</h2>
      <blockquote class="mt-8 font-display italic font-book text-h3 text-ink leading-snug max-w-measure text-balance">
        &ldquo;{{ site.founder.quote }}&rdquo;
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-6 text-body font-medium text-ink">{{ site.founder.name }}</p>
      <p class="text-small text-ink-muted">{{ site.founder.title }}, {{ site.founder.org }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ CLOSE #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy-deep py-section">
  {% include "partials/facet-field.njk" %}
  <div class="shell relative text-center flex flex-col items-center">
    <span class="eyebrow-on-navy fade-up">Our Ventures</span>
    <h2 class="mt-4 font-display font-light text-display-2 text-navy-on max-w-[16ch] text-balance fade-up" style="animation-delay:80ms">
      See where <em class="italic text-navy-accent font-book">we operate.</em>
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-10 fade-up" style="animation-delay:160ms">
      <a href="/ventures/" class="btn-primary">Explore our ventures</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
